Building with the attached random configuration file, 

  LD      init/built-in.o
crypto/built-in.o:(.rodata+0x1560c): undefined reference to `RSA_public_key_algo
rithm'

Naively changing

CONFIG_PUBLIC_KEY_ALGO_RSA=m

to

CONFIG_PUBLIC_KEY_ALGO_RSA=y

seems to fix that.

--u3/rZRmxL6MmkK24
